Note that this check is performed against the passed in actor’s serial"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"executor, meaning that if another actor uses the same serial executor–by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using that actor’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Actor\/unownedExecutor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" as its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Actor\/unownedExecutor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"–this check will succeed, as from a concurrency"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"safety perspective, the serial executor guarantees mutual exclusion of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"those two actors."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method can only be used from synchronous functions, as asynchronous"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"functions should instead perform a normal method call to the actor, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will hop task execution to the target actor if necessary."}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because this check is performed against the actor’s serial executor,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"if another actor uses the same serial executor–by using","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"another actor’s executor as its own ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Actor\/unownedExecutor","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"–this check will succeed.  Fom a concurrency safety perspective,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the serial executor guarantees mutual exclusion of those two actors.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"t